Fluid dynamics — motion, forces, transport and evidence (@fluid-dynamics: 0, is #chapter, #fluid-dynamics "foundations/Read-fluid-dynamics-from-zero.lingua#r_1JWVG3WSPPTZW4BP2N1BZPPZ12") { r_7PQW1WDHK708BFV23MD8ET61VZ
Start with [Read fluid dynamics from zero](foundations/Read-fluid-dynamics-from-zero.lingua#r_1JWVG3WSPPTZW4BP2N1BZPPZ12) and an ordinary stream of water or air. Learn to identify the fluid, its boundaries, the forces and the observations needed to explain what moves. Work from amounts and pressure to fields, conservation laws and the assumptions behind a useful flow model.

Whole books and increasingly demanding questions develop the subject. The shared mathematical, thermodynamic and measurement steps appear where they are used and retain their other continuations. Ordinary references to related fields do not make completing those entire subjects a prerequisite.

**Foundations:** [Read fluid dynamics from zero](foundations/Read-fluid-dynamics-from-zero.lingua#r_1JWVG3WSPPTZW4BP2N1BZPPZ12) · [Observe a fluid and the service it provides](foundations/Observe-a-fluid-and-the-service-it-provides.lingua#r_2N3M0S840BRKVXMQ7QPNK77X5Z) · [Fluid quantities, units and English–Portuguese vocabulary](foundations/Fluid-quantities-units-and-English-Portuguese-vocabulary.lingua#r_1GH7DF6D8NAQCMZ44VPZ506VV3) · [Material properties and the state of the fluid](foundations/Material-properties-and-the-state-of-the-fluid.lingua#r_5875X8MW02A7JNF72S8MDJSANN) · [Continuum fields, molecular scales and relaxation](foundations/Continuum-fields-molecular-scales-and-relaxation.lingua#r_52W3FJ90C69MPGFW3QNYXA6Q80).

**Statics:** [Pressure reference, stress and a pressure measurement](statics/Pressure-reference-stress-and-a-pressure-measurement.lingua#r_5KKK4Q5KPBS1CCXVZ72RYBJMKK) · [Hydrostatic balance, gravity and density variation](statics/Hydrostatic-balance-gravity-and-density-variation.lingua#r_0BMK5JN8XP72JR1WQG5B52PFMS) · [Manometers, layered fluids and connected pressure paths](statics/Manometers-layered-fluids-and-connected-pressure-paths.lingua#r_5C2HW614FRPGT2H6QD3RY30G0J) · [Pressure forces, moments and the centre of pressure](statics/Pressure-forces-moments-and-the-centre-of-pressure.lingua#r_3ZK38BANREQ9K4KZ4YZ3NZQCYX) · [Buoyancy, floating equilibrium and small displacements](statics/Buoyancy-floating-equilibrium-and-small-displacements.lingua#r_4BR14XK13BE96AV41F3P76D8GK) · [Accelerated containers and rigid-body rotation](statics/Accelerated-containers-and-rigid-body-rotation.lingua#r_6JVXB2M9DRSZ6GP1WJCH6ZF73M).

**Mathematics:** [Coordinates, fields and local versus material change](mathematics/Coordinates-fields-and-local-versus-material-change.lingua#r_3ZSP7RX2565ZAA91ZD418BAEVN) · [Velocity gradients, strain rate and local rotation](mathematics/Velocity-gradients-strain-rate-and-local-rotation.lingua#r_37ABTXR3GBSJXJ39FACENFATQ6) · [Fluxes, oriented surfaces and coordinate measures](mathematics/Fluxes-oriented-surfaces-and-coordinate-measures.lingua#r_67DWMZBFCRCW464EP31KR60ZV9) · [Differential equations, boundary data and a solvable flow model](mathematics/Differential-equations-boundary-data-and-a-solvable-flow-model.lingua#r_5HKW1NTEG39SPQQ5PF9THNHCMX).

