[Fluid dynamics sources — books, courses, methods and physical evidence](Sources.lingua#r_3Y3TVV9VQAB50M2ZSECK5JTYVG) identifies the complete readings, specialist methods, access conditions and primary evidence. Return to [Physics — fields, matter, motion and physical evidence](../Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W), [Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation](../../engineering/Engineering.lingua#r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68), [Ergon — mathematics, science, and engineering](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001), [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB) and [Hephaestus](../../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001) as the physical problem connects with other work. Questions about explanation, evidence and purpose connect with [Philosophy](../../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001). Water services, machinery, thermal engineering, rheology, atmospheric/ocean science, vacuum systems and semiconductor manufacturing can reuse this fluid foundation while keeping their specialist scope.

